<title>USA: Information Resource FY 96 net loss widens.</title>
<headline>Information Resource FY 96 net loss widens.</headline>
<dateline>BALTIMORE, Md. 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twelve Mos	Twelve Mos</p>
<p>						   Ended	     Ended</p>
<p>						  Dec 31,	   Dec 31,</p>
<p>						     1996	     1995</p>
<p> Revenues				 $14,317,423	$8,149,224</p>
<p> Net loss				 (7,084,550)	 (695,251)</p>
<p> Loss per common share		     (1.34)	     (.20)</p>
<p>Weighted average number of</p>
<p>  common shares outstanding	   5,304,984	 3,826,831</p>
<p>NOTE:  Information Resources Engineering Inc said its net income for fiscal year 1996 includes a one-time charge of $2,216,200 for the write off of unamortized acquired intangible assets from the Connective Strategies Inc acquisition.</p>
</text>
